Cantoni payment branding review is intentionally pending.

Do not remove this file before final go-live until all of these are true:
- `npm run audit:payment-branding` has no blockers.
- `npm run test:payments` returns ok=true for the current public Stripe Payment Links.
- Stripe Checkout merchant shows Cantoni Digital Studio.
- PayPal is selectable in a real browser session for both public Payment Links.
- no EC8 or unrelated brand/account text appears in PayPal.
- do not submit the final payment step during verification.
- latest structured evidence in `sales-kit/payment_branding_review_evidence.json` has release_ready=true.

This flag does not block local artifact generation, lead research, draft work, or no-payment checkout QA.
